Overlaps and bonus/penalty amounts depend on whether **`contractedDurationMinutes`** is set (interval length from **start + contracted**) vs **`EndTime`**. Same teacher can get different concurrency adjustments across sessions if some rows have contract duration and others do not, or if **start times are missing** (row skipped).

